    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You touch one willing creature, and choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Poison. Until the spell ends, the target can take a Magic action to exhale a 15-foot Cone. Each creature in that area makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 damage of the chosen type on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.",
        "Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.",
        "* - (a hot pepper)"
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You touch one willing creature, and choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Poison. Until the spell ends, the target can take a <a>Magic</a> action to exhale a 15-foot <a>Cone</a>. Each creature in that area makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 damage of the chosen type on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.</p> <span>* - (a hot pepper)</span> </div>",
